{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:18 2026-09-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:18 2026-09-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:18 2026-09-03 HKT</p><p>今（3日）晨11時許，一名老婦被發現在西環堅尼地城新海旁對開載浮載沉，途人報警求助，消防到場拯救，成功將老婦救起，她仍然清醒，由水警輪送上岸，再轉送醫院治理。據了解，女事主與家人爭執，一氣之下走到岸邊跳海自殺，幸途人發現檢回一命。</p><img alt=\"女事主由水警輪送上岸。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fd69f2dcf761a5e5d54a32f78bac220/2026-09/11_1_2.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女事主由水警輪送上岸。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e79c29a33f4197e37ea43e454d8d8cd3/2026-09/14_3.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女事主送院治理。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab3517953550e77300054d22e8d297ff/2026-09/12_3_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女事主由消防救起。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/beed6d52452a79c9fb878de9bb108d62/2026-09/13_4.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防將事主救起。fb：西環變幻時\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa6cf153f8539e282ab67cc26ad92d6f/2026-09/01_1_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防將事主救起。fb：西環變幻時\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/77a87b27ed7be70d5c0d7140120adf6f/2026-09/02_2.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防將事主救起。fb：西環變幻時\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f58de95f064289c532d9f4eafc772fc/2026-09/03_4_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防將事主救起。fb：西環變幻時\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d72cda4dd6d8c4a26895d9df71272fd/2026-09/04_3_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"大批消防車到場。fb：西環變幻時\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88d24837878ce8614502e6fefd9c9f76/2026-09/05_5_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"水警輪一度到場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b5c0c595e41b5fd4c7bf7264e715c77/2026-09/08_0_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"救護車與警車到場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a179b03a445ad9bb2fdabe7bd9fb688/2026-09/09_0_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"水警輪一度到場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/79569ddbe3dd365007d22b4d0389a2a2/2026-09/78a892e8-f69c-4d6d-92b2-f0d62a6030f3.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T05:04:26.013606+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}